.TH BOMBERGOLF 1
.SH NAME
bombergolf \- bomber flight game
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/bombergolf
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I BomberGolf
is a bomber flight game.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Fly over trees and targets, change speed, and drop bombs with space. Destroy every target; fewer key presses score better.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B Left / a
Turn left
.TP
.B Right / d
Turn right
.TP
.B Up / w
Speed up
.TP
.B Down / s
Slow down
.TP
.B space
Drop bomb
.TP
.B Enter / r
Restart
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/bombergolf.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR draw3d (2),
.IR tone (2),
.IR wm (1)
